# 25. Design Direction

Design Koro as:

* Modern
* Clean
* Friendly
* Community-focused
* Language-focused
* Accessible
* Mobile-first

Avoid:

* Complex SaaS dashboard appearance
* Too many buttons
* Too many menus
* Large forms
* Unnecessary animations
