# 29. Authentication Security

Use the existing JWT system.

Implement:

* Access token handling
* Refresh token handling
* Automatic refresh
* Centralized 401 handling
* Logout on invalid refresh
* Protected routes

Do not expose tokens unnecessarily in client storage.

The backend remains responsible for authorization.

